guide forever/horde/02-the-barrens
title The Barrens
faction Horde
levels 12-17
zone The Barrens
next forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest

# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route (Tauren export, the Barrens
# visit at 12.7-16.6); not yet play-tested on Forever.
#
# Arrivals, all at the Crossroads: Tauren at about 12 from Mulgore
# (Crossroads flight path and bind already done), Undead at about 13 from
# Tirisfal Glades, Skyborne at about 14.6 from Zephras Isle, Orcs and Trolls at
# about 16 from their own Barrens guide (most of this guide is already done for
# them: the engine skips what is).
#
# Flow: Crossroads -> plains around town (plainstriders, raptors, zhevra) ->
# Razormane camp east -> Far Watch Post (Tauren Warriors) -> Ratchet (flight
# path) -> Southsea beach, twice -> Crossroads -> Razormane camp again,
# Echeyakee -> the Sludge
# Fen console -> the Dry Hills (harpies, Chen's keg) -> Regthar, the Forgotten
# Pools, the Kolkar -> Crossroads -> Stagnant Oasis and the raptor nests ->
# Ratchet -> Crossroads -> Lushwater Oasis -> Crossroads -> north: harpy
# lieutenants, Wenikee at the Mor'shan Rampart -> Crossroads. The guide ends at
# the Crossroads; the next one walks you to Orgrimmar and the zeppelin.
#
# Deviations from the export (to keep one loop per hub):
# - The simulator binds back and forth between Ratchet and the Crossroads and
#   hearths twice; here you stay bound at the Crossroads and walk: Ratchet is
#   reached on foot twice, both times on the way between other objectives.
# - Stolen Booty (888) is done right after the Missing Shipment, while you are
#   still at the beach, not on a later Ratchet trip.
# - Fungal Spores (848) is picked at the mushrooms around the Forgotten Pools,
#   on the same stop as the pools themselves.
# - The Sepulcher flight path and bind (16.6) move to the start of the next
#   guide, where you are.
# - Rilli Greasygob (3923) is taken here from Wenikee, who you stand next to
#   anyway; the export takes it at 20.4 on a later Barrens visit. Its turn-in
#   comes in a later guide, outside Orgrimmar.
# - In Ratchet, Sputtervalve, Wrenix and Gazlowe up the hill come before
#   Wharfmaster Dizzywig on the dock: the dock is on the way to the beach.
#
# Dropped:
# - Chen's Empty Keg part 2 (821): a horn from the southern thunder lizards and
#   a walk back to Ratchet for 1350 XP; with it the third part (822, in
#   forever/horde/04-the-barrens), which would need a flight to Ratchet for
#   970 XP. The first part (819) stays: its keg lies on the Dry Hills loop and
#   Ratchet is on the way.
# - Apothecary Zamah (853) and Hamuul Runetotem (1489): the route never turns
#   them in.
#
# Class quests: Tauren Warriors carry Veteran Uzzek (1505) and Tauren Shamans
# Call of Fire (1523) from forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore: Path of Defense,
# Thun'grim Firegaze and Forged Steel (1498, 1502, 1503); Call of Fire (1524-
# 1527) with Telf Joolam on the Durotar bank of the river. Orcs and Trolls do
# these in their own Barrens guide. Forever's Call of Fire (1527) also gives
# the Totem of Charged Flames (Wowhead Forever's Shaman page).
# Path of Defense stays Tauren-only here: Undead and Skyborne Warriors learn
# Defensive Stance from their own start guides' class quests.
#
# Far Watch Post is for Tauren Warriors only (Uzzek): Orcs and Trolls hand in
# Conscript of the Horde (840) in Durotar and Crossroads Conscription (842)
# in their own Barrens guide; since the Tauren start dropped its Durotar trip
# (Razor Hill), Tauren no longer carry 840.
#
# No grind stops: the export has none here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Crossroads is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn.
  getfp "Crossroads" npc 3615         -- Devrak, the wind rider master
  sethome "The Crossroads" npc 3934   -- Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind
  accept 870                          -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 844                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 867                          -- Darsok Swiftdagger: the harpies come later, in the Dry Hills
  accept 871                          -- Thork
  accept 5041
  accept 848                          -- Apothecary Helbrim
  accept 1492
  accept 869                          -- Gazrog

step Plainstriders and raptors
  tip Plainstriders and Sunscale raptors roam the plains all around the Crossroads, thickest to the north.
  collect 5087 quest 844.1
  collect 5062 quest 869.1

step The Crossroads
  turnin 844                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 845
  turnin 869                          -- Gazrog

step The Zhevra
  tip Zhevra Runners graze north and east of town.
  goto 52.5,27.5 "Zhevra"
  collect 5086 quest 845.1

step The Crossroads
  turnin 845                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 903

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East: the Razormane and Far Watch

step Razormane camp
  tip The Savannah Prowlers hunt the plains between town and the Razormane camp to the east. In the camp, Water Seekers and Thornweavers hold the western half, Hunters the middle; the supply crates sit at its eastern end.
  goto 55.0,26.0 "Razormane camp"
  collect 5096 quest 903.1
  kill 3267 quest 871.1
  kill 3268 quest 871.2
  kill 3265 quest 871.3
  collect 12708 quest 5041.1 @58.8,25.8

step Kranal Fiss
  only Tauren,Shaman
  tip Kranal Fiss stands on the ridge north of the Razormane camp.
  turnin 1523
  accept 1524

step Far Watch Post
  only Tauren,Warrior
  tip Follow the road east to the outpost above the Southfury River.
  turnin 1505                         -- Uzzek
  accept 1498

step Thunder lizards across the river
  only Tauren,Warrior
  zone Durotar
  tip Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze just across the bridge below Far Watch Post.
  collect 6486 quest 1498.1

step Uzzek
  only Tauren,Warrior
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1498
  accept 1502

step Telf Joolam
  only Tauren,Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Telf waits on the riverbank south of Far Watch Post, across the bridge.
  turnin 1524
  accept 1525

step Dustwind Gulch cultists
  only Tauren,Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch in northern Durotar; they drop the Reagent Pouch. The Fire Tar comes from the Razormane on your next visit to their camp.
  collect 6652 quest 1525.2

step Thun'grim Firegaze
  only Tauren,Warrior
  zone The Barrens
  tip Thun'grim camps beside the road from the Crossroads to Ratchet. The Stolen Iron Chest sits in the south of the Razormane camp just north of him.
  turnin 1502
  accept 1503
  collect 6534 quest 1503.1
  turnin 1503

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ratchet and the Southsea beach

