# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east loop

step The Disruption Ends
  tip Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them.
  kill 3269 quest 872.1
  kill 3266 quest 872.2
  collect 5063 quest 872.3 @58.5,27.0
  collect 5026 quest 1525.1 only Tauren,Shaman

step Telf Joolam
  only Tauren,Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Telf makes Fire Sapta from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the Minor Manifestation of Fire, kill it for the Glowing Ember, then place the ember in the brazier.
  turnin 1525
  accept 1526
  collect 6655 quest 1526.1
  turnin 1526
  accept 1527

step Kranal Fiss
  only Tauren,Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1527 reward 5176 263412      -- Kranal Fiss: Searing Totem, your Fire Totem and the Totem of Charged Flames

step Echeyakee
  zone The Barrens
  tip Echeyakee, a white lion, prowls the plains north of the Razormane camp.
  collect 5100 quest 881.1

step Samophlange
  tip The Control Console stands at the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles beside it.
  turnin 894
  accept 900
  interact 4072 quest 900.1
  interact 61935 quest 900.3
  interact 61936 quest 900.2
  turnin 900
  accept 901
  collect 5089 quest 901.1
  turnin 901
  accept 902                          -- Sputtervalve in Ratchet: later, on the way

step The Dry Hills
  tip West to the Dry Hills. The Witchwing harpies nest all over them; any of them can drop a talon. Chen's Empty Keg lies in their hills.
  collect 5064 quest 867.1
  collect 4926 @37.9,16.2
  accept 819

step Regthar Deathgate
  tip South to Regthar's watch post on the Kolkar border.
  accept 855

step The Forgotten Pools
  tip The pools lie just north of Regthar. Walk into the water to explore them; the Laden Mushrooms for Helbrim grow around them. Kill every Kolkar you pass for bracers.
  complete 870 @45.3,22.8
  collect 5012 quest 848.1
  collect 5030 quest 855.1

step Kolkar camps
  tip Kolkar Wranglers and Stormers hold the camps south of Regthar.
  goto 46.5,31.5 "Kolkar camps"
  collect 5030 quest 855.1

step Regthar Deathgate
  turnin 855

