# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South and Ratchet

step The Stagnant Oasis
  tip South-east of the Crossroads. Test the seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank.
  interact 3737 quest 877.1

step Raptor nests
  tip The three nests sit together in the Raptor Grounds south-west of the oasis; Sunscale Scytheclaws guard them.
  interact 6906 quest 905.3
  interact 6907 quest 905.1
  interact 6908 quest 905.2

step Ratchet
  tip East to Ratchet, on the coast.
  turnin 902                          -- Sputtervalve
  accept 3921
  turnin 819                          -- Brewmaster Drohn
  vendor nearest

step The Crossroads
  tip Back west along the road.
  turnin 877                          -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 880
  turnin 905                          -- Sergra Darkthorn

step Lushwater Oasis
  tip Oasis Snapjaws crawl around Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads, and around the Stagnant Oasis.
  collect 5098 quest 880.1

step The Crossroads
  turnin 880                          -- Tonga Runetotem
