# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North

step Harpy Lieutenants
  tip The Witchwing Slayers hold the western Dry Hills; they wear the rings.
  collect 5065 quest 875.1

step Wenikee Boltbucket
  tip East to the Mor'shan Rampart; Wenikee stands at the camp just south of it.
  turnin 3921
  accept 3922

step Nugget Slugs
  tip The tool buckets with the slugs lie around the Venture Co. drill site in the Sludge Fen, east of Wenikee.
  collect 11143 quest 3922.1

step Wenikee Boltbucket
  turnin 3922
  accept 3923                         -- Keep it: Rilli Greasygob stands outside Orgrimmar; a later guide hands it in

step The Crossroads
  tip Walk back south to the Crossroads. The next guide starts here and takes you to Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.
  turnin 875                          -- Darsok Swiftdagger
